<h2>Access token created</h2>

<article>
  <p>Copy <strong><%= @connection.name %></strong> now, it is shown only once:</p>

  <pre><code id="access-token-secret"><%= @secret %></code></pre>

  <p>To use it in Claude Code, for all your projects:</p>
  <pre><code>claude mcp add --transport http --scope user done <%= mcp_url %> \
  --header "Authorization: Bearer <%= @secret %>"</code></pre>
  <p>More in the <%= link_to "help", help_path(anchor: "ai-clients") %>.</p>

  <%= render "connections/grants", connection: @connection %>

  <footer><%= link_to "Done", user_access_tokens_path %></footer>
</article>
